Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:05.10,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,CodexForge tackles 400 Kaggle NeuroGolf ARC tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.35,0:00:09.65,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,Each solution is an executable ONNX program.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.95,0:00:14.65,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,Correctness comes first; memory and parameter cost determine the\Nscore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:21.70,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,CodexForge separates reasoning from orchestration.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:29.50,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,A deterministic Python control plane manages long-lived parallel\NCodex workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:37.35,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,The repository packages the runner, quota supervisor, dashboard,\Nprompts, tests, and task-local workspaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:44.75,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,Here, a live campaign selects tasks 12 through 15, with at most two\Nworkers active.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:52.35,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,Each worker receives exactly one Kaggle NeuroGolf ARC task and an\Nisolated workspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.60,0:01:00.45,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,Workers inspect examples and ARC-GEN generators, infer\Ntransformations, and synthesize ONNX computational graphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:09.10,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,The dashboard turns structured Codex events into readable phases\Nwhile retaining raw JSONL logs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:18.15,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,Workers can run for hours, so a parent reasoning agent should not\Nstay active merely to poll them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.45,0:01:27.35,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,Deterministic Python handles concurrency, locks, process\Nsupervision, retries, timeouts, cancellation, and resumability.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:37.00,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,As task 12 completes, its builder, explanation, ONNX submission,\Nresult, and event history become visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.30,0:01:46.00,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,The official scorer rewards correct ONNX programs with lower memory-\Nplus-parameter cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.30,0:01:56.40,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,Every worker tests packaged examples, probes fresh generator cases,\Ndebugs failures, and iterates toward a smaller graph.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:02:07.20,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,Task-local READMEs record validation counts, exhaustive tests, cost,\Nscore, hashes, and the final submission path.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:16.45,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,Open worker slots are filled automatically, so queued tasks start\Nwithout human coordination.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.75,0:02:26.95,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,Completed tasks leave durable evidence while other Codex workers\Ncontinue reasoning and optimizing in parallel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.25,0:02:37.80,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,By now, tasks 12 through 14 are verified, while task 15 continues\Ntesting and optimization.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.05,0:02:44.45,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,Quota monitoring runs independently from the worker control plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.90,0:02:52.15,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,Without the dashboard, parallel work becomes a wall of terminals,\Nlogs, and manual status checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:03:00.25,Voiceover,,0,0,0,,The principle is simple: use Codex for reasoning; use deterministic\Nsoftware for orchestration.
